5h[?2026l[?2026h[21A[19B[38;2;215;175;255m⠓⠀[0m[4B[2A[2C[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[21A[19B[15C[38;2;124;124;124m3[0m[4B[2A[2C[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[21A[19B[38;2;215;175;255m⠋[0m[4B[2A[2C[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[21A[J[38;2;124;124;124mThe problem: Let $D$ be an integral domain, $m,n$ coprime positive integers. If [0m[38;2;124;124;124m$a,b \in D$ satisfy $a^m = b^m$ and $a^n = b^n$, then $a = b$.[0m

