[38;2;124;124;124mCase 1: $a = 0$ or $b = 0$. If $a = 0$, then $a^m = 0 = b^m$, so $b^m = 0$, and [0m[38;2;124;124;124msince $D$ is an integral domain, $b = 0 = a$. Similarly if $b = 0$.[0m

